coupon bundle by (1) scanning the QR code or accessing this page via your mobile browser. (2) downloading the Temu application through the provided affiliate link or QR code. This offer is for new app users only.","activity_requirements":"Shipping fees may apply. To qualify as an eligible New App User for this activity, you must be an individual meeting ALL of these requirements: 1)You download the Temu app and log in with your Temu account on your device. 2)You activate this activity within {{hours}} hours of the device's first downloading. 3)You haven't made any purchases on Temu before.","origin_currency_rule":{"rules":"Rules","coupon_rule_v1":"<strong>Explanation of displayed value</strong></br><p>The coupon's value is in {{originCurrency}} and can be used for {{originAmount}} off orders over {{originMinAmount}}. {{amount}} and {{minAmount}} are converted based on the {{originCurrency}} to {{currency}} exchange rate.</p><p>Due to changes in the exchange rate happening in real time, the {{currency}} amounts are for reference only.</p>","coupon_rule_v2":"<strong>Explanation of displayed value</strong></br><p>The coupon bundle's value is in {{originCurrency}} and the total value is {{originAmount}} and can be used on qualified orders. {{amount}} is converted based on the {{originCurrency}} to {{currency}} exchange rate. </p><p>Due to changes in the exchange rate happening in real time, the {{currency}} amount is for reference only.</p>","coupon_rule_v3":"The coupon bundle's value is in {{originCurrency}} and the total value is {{originAmount}} and can be used on qualified orders. {{amount}} is converted based on the {{originCurrency}} to {{currency}} exchange rate. Due to changes in the exchange rate happening in real time, the {{currency}} amount is for reference only."},"coupon_bundle_rules":{"coupon_item":"{{amount}} for a min. order {{minAmount}}","coupon_item_v2":"{{couponCount}} × {{amount}} for a min. order {{minAmount}}","coupon_rules_part1":"*For illustrat